TypeSpark — AI Writing & Tone Assistant (Derivative Work)
Copyright 2026 Vonarian (https://github.com/Vonarian/TypeSpark)

This software is a modified fork of GemType (https://github.com/riponcm/GemType)
originally developed by Ripon Chandra Malo (Matily). Modifications include:
- Rebranding to TypeSpark (name, icons, manifests, and UI labels) per TRADEMARK.md
- Unified storage layer (`extension/src/storage.js`)
- Adaptive Gemini generation config & thought filtering (`extension/src/background-helper.js`)
- Generation controls, custom preset pills CRUD, and minimum text length threshold (`extension/src/options.*`)
- Interactive preview tooltip, keyboard navigation, and shortcut trigger (`extension/src/content/*`)

